<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Vindhella–Sverrestigen loop — Rimskjold–Vindhella–Sverrestigen loop</name><desc>The signed circuit from Rimskjold follows the complete nineteenth-century Vindhella hairpins, joins Sverrestigen at its eastern junction and returns around Klanten, using the required short road link at Rimskjold. The older Gamlevegen shortcuts and longer road return are excluded.

